  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bd3a94c0d14ea0146a5cfd133f70b89e, type: 3}
  m_Name: room2 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3638918418da10f45b03bb3bfe0d7d3f, type: 3}
  lines:
  - text: In my attempts to hold on to you, I somehow lost sight of reason.
    startTime: 0
    endTime: 3
  - text: ' What were we supposed to do with ourselves  in a place like this? They
      were always watching.'
    startTime: 4
    endTime: 9
  - text: "All I wanted was to swallow your feelings completely and keep you close
      to me.  I wanted to take it all in\u2026"
    startTime: 10
    endTime: 17
  - text: "but it got stuck in my throat... and it\u2019s still stuck there.  I\u2019m
      afraid that if I let it out now, it will come out ugly and deformed."
    startTime: 18
    endTime: 24
  - text: "Since I last saw you, something has been tearing at my chest from within. 
      I\u2019ve stopped believing it will ever let me go. "
    startTime: 25
    endTime: 31
  - text: "If there is still a heart in me\u2026 then it belongs to you.  Piece by
      piece you ate away what remained of me."
    startTime: 32
    endTime: 39
  - text: "and now you\u2019re rising\u2026 higher\u2026 towards my throat."
    startTime: 40
    endTime: 48
